214
01:03:03,000 --> 01:03:04,125
<font color=#DAF7A6>Seeing is believing.</font>

215
01:03:07,250 --> 01:03:10,292
<font color=#DAF7A6>"If ye had faith</font>
<font color=#DAF7A6>as a grain of mustard seed,</font>

